// Grounded Brain: rolling conversation summaries and learned memories
// Eraser "Flow Chart" diagram-as-code
title Rolling summaries and learned memories
direction right
colorMode bold

Chat reply saved [shape: oval, icon: message-square, color: green]
Due [shape: diamond, label: "messages − summaryMessageCount ≥ 8?"]
Done [shape: oval, color: gray]
Publish [icon: zap, color: purple, label: "EventPublisher.conversationSummaryRequested\nevent id = conversation + bucket (dedupes)"]
Job [icon: message-square, color: purple, label: "summarize-conversation job\n(one at a time per conversation)"]
OpenAI [icon: openai, color: orange, label: "OpenAI: previous summary + only NEW messages → updated summary"]
Save summary [icon: postgres, color: blue, label: "UPDATE conversation.summary, summaryMessageCount"]
Mem0 [icon: brain, color: purple, label: "Mem0: learn facts from new messages (max 16)"]

Chat reply saved > Due
Due > Done: no
Due > Publish: yes
Publish > Job
Job > OpenAI > Save summary
Job > Mem0
